title: if your keyboard sends double-presses
pid: 6127bf1b-b72c-4444-b9cc-6930f9695bf1
body: |2-
  - Stopgap (usage): Read the next item before staging anything,
    so that if two things get staged in what should have been one keystroke, you'll notice.
  - Permanent fix (code): debounce staging in magit.
